      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Still an issue in 2019.08.16.18.20. Based on what Merlin found, the issue is related to VRC_SceneDescriptor.autoSpatializeAudioSources.\nWhen this value is true, the build tab looks like the issue described in the canny. When it is false, the build tab looks as expected. This bool propagates to the \"setupRequired\" variable on line 227 of VRCSdkControlPanelBuilder.cs which is then used to determine if it should display the rest of the build options.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
